[en.FOCUS_C12_UNINVITED_GUEST]
Uninvited Guest

[en.FOCUS_C12_UNINVITED_GUEST_desc]
The telegram sent by Marble Pie successfully piqued the interest of the alicorn who called herself Empress. Under her command, a massive airship appeared in the skies above the rock farm...

[zh.FOCUS_C12_UNINVITED_GUEST]
不速之客

[zh.FOCUS_C12_UNINVITED_GUEST_desc]
玉琪派发送的电报成功让那位自称为女皇的天角兽的兴趣，在她的命令下，一架巨型飞艇出现在了采石农场的上空...

